    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36163" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντᾰτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stimulating, aphrodisiac,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Xenocr.
				16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.341
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				11.35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sexually vigorous,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷον] -άτερον πρὸς τὴν μεῖξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					19.5.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντατικόν, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σατύριον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.128
			</span></i>.</div>
